            <run fontsize='10'>To hide the Submarket detail, click the &quot;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>-</run>
            <run fontsize='10'>&quot; above the Region. To show Submarket detail, click the &quot;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>+</run>
