              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#800002' fontsize='9'>Analytics DRI</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>: REDACTED_EMAIL</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#800002' fontsize='9'>Purpose</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>: This dashboard is used by PreSales teams and cross-functional stakeholders for tracking actuals against OKR goals.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#800002' fontsize='9'>Data Freshness</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>: Data refreshes everyday at 10AM PST.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#800002' fontsize='9'>Weekly Reporting Cadence</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>: A reporting week runs from Monday to Sunday (so all CWs closed within that timeframe will count for that week). However, if the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>first Monday</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'> of the quarter does not start on the first </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'>day</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontsize='9'> of the quarter (ex. Q2&apos;23 started on 4/3), the first week of the quarter will have CWs from the first days of the quarter (ex. CWs on 4/1 and 4/2 will count for the week of 4/3).</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
                <format attr='shape' value='Info/1024px-Info_i_blue.svg.png' />
                <format attr='size' value='2' />
